(6385193, 945956, 61961, '<td valign="top">Sometimes greens and yellows can seem more warm than cool, but here there is added coolness in the color of the cage and in the hints of blue in the background.</td>', 'Sometimes greens and yellows can seem more warm than cool, but here there is added coolness in the color of the cage and in the hints of blue in the background.', '2011-04-13 15:08:55.000000', NULL, 1),
