(6385940, 945872, 129267, '<td valign="top">To be frank, I feel like I''ve seen this shot many many times before. As such, it makes the expectations a bit high. I find a few things to be bothersome, the island is a bit tight on the females head, and the tilted horizon makes me feel a bit dizzy. Romance and chivalry is for women, and I think I would have preferred to see her expression of being woo''d as opposed to his, (or both if you could have managed). I do like that the water looks refreshing, and the sky has a good bit of saturation</td>', 'To be frank, I feel like I''ve seen this shot many many times before. As such, it makes the expectations a bit high. I find a few things to be bothersome, the island is a bit tight on the females head, and the tilted horizon makes me feel a bit dizzy. Romance and chivalry is for women, and I think I would have preferred to see her expression of being woo''d as opposed to his, (or both if you could have managed). I do like that the water looks refreshing, and the sky has a good bit of saturation', '2011-04-14 05:02:11.000000', NULL, 1),
