(6386021, 945335, 10785, '<td valign="top">This is a photo filled with a joyful emotion. There are some lighting problems though. The light fades off to the left of the image a lot giving it an unbalanced feel. The dog is in too much shadow in my opinion and the brightest spot is on the woman''s mid section. My eye is drawn to just about her knee which is not really where you want the focal point. The lack of back-lighting is noticeable. Great staged shot and lot''s of fun! Good colors!</td>', 'This is a photo filled with a joyful emotion. There are some lighting problems though. The light fades off to the left of the image a lot giving it an unbalanced feel. The dog is in too much shadow in my opinion and the brightest spot is on the woman''s mid section. My eye is drawn to just about her knee which is not really where you want the focal point. The lack of back-lighting is noticeable. Great staged shot and lot''s of fun! Good colors!', '2011-04-14 10:00:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6386022, 945322, 10785, '<td valign="top">This is great for a background and really needs a person to fill the space in the left.</td>', 'This is great for a background and really needs a person to fill the space in the left.', '2011-04-14 10:02:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6386025, 946053, 10785, '<td valign="top">Very cool colors. I just don''t think you captured the ice very well as it doesn''t stand out from the background at all. Compare to the other ice shot with a blue background in this challenge... this one is missing the luminosity and texture of the ice.</td>', 'Very cool colors. I just don''t think you captured the ice very well as it doesn''t stand out from the background at all. Compare to the other ice shot with a blue background in this challenge... this one is missing the luminosity and texture of the ice.', '2011-04-14 10:04:34.000000', NULL, 1),
