(6387766, 946059, 129267, '<td valign="top">The colors in this are nice, however it''s hard to define which challenge it''d be more appropriate in. violet is a mix of both warm and cool colors, so it''s kind of cheating. :D<br/> <br/>On the formal side of this, it''s not terribly interesting of a composition. I''m not sure which flower --if any-- is important, which when combined with the title makes this image easy to pass up.</td>', 'The colors in this are nice, however it''s hard to define which challenge it''d be more appropriate in. violet is a mix of both warm and cool colors, so it''s kind of cheating. :D On the formal side of this, it''s not terribly interesting of a composition. I''m not sure which flower --if any-- is important, which when combined with the title makes this image easy to pass up.', '2011-04-16 05:48:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(6387767, 946129, 129267, '<td valign="top">nice landscape. I''m not sure if it''s me or the photo, but the horizont seems to tilt heavily. <br/> <br/>I''m surprised a bit that the water in the river is so green looking. <br/> <br/>anyways, great photo. I think for this challenge I would have liked a bit more color than just the sky.</td>', 'nice landscape. I''m not sure if it''s me or the photo, but the horizont seems to tilt heavily.  I''m surprised a bit that the water in the river is so green looking.  anyways, great photo. I think for this challenge I would have liked a bit more color than just the sky.', '2011-04-16 05:50:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6387770, 945843, 129267, '<td valign="top">well composed, I like the foreground, the children and the ships. the tree areas on the right side seem to be suffering a bit from either post processing, or maybe some lens problems.</td>', 'well composed, I like the foreground, the children and the ships. the tree areas on the right side seem to be suffering a bit from either post processing, or maybe some lens problems.', '2011-04-16 05:52:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6387772, 946017, 129267, '<td valign="top">cute title. <br/> <br/>only thing in this I would do differently* is cool down the background a bit, it has quite a bit or red/yellow adding some unnecessary warmth (*only for this challenge)</td>', 'cute title.  only thing in this I would do differently* is cool down the background a bit, it has quite a bit or red/yellow adding some unnecessary warmth (*only for this challenge)', '2011-04-16 05:54:21.000000', NULL, 1),
(6387773, 945925, 129267, '<td valign="top">very nice. the black card works well for contrast. <br/> <br/>only thing that irks me about this is the border, it seems so obtrusive into the image frame.</td>', 'very nice. the black card works well for contrast.  only thing that irks me about this is the border, it seems so obtrusive into the image frame.', '2011-04-16 05:55:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6387775, 945981, 129267, '<td valign="top">I like it, and have been wanting to explore an idea similar to this. <br/> <br/>There seems to be something missing, I''m not sure if it''s compositional or not. I think it''s a combination of the angle the photo is taken, and the lack of a definitive focal point. I don''t know where to look. maybe create paths that the eye can follow, and fill in the surrounding zones?</td>', 'I like it, and have been wanting to explore an idea similar to this.  There seems to be something missing, I''m not sure if it''s compositional or not. I think it''s a combination of the angle the photo is taken, and the lack of a definitive focal point. I don''t know where to look. maybe create paths that the eye can follow, and fill in the surrounding zones?', '2011-04-16 05:58:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6387776, 945983, 129267, '<td valign="top">The only thing that I find strange or that I dislike about this, is the models hand position. I''m not sure if she''s going to pop the bubble, or trying to get someones attention to the bubble, or ...<br/> <br/>lighting is nice, i really like that background, and the textures there.</td>', 'The only thing that I find strange or that I dislike about this, is the models hand position. I''m not sure if she''s going to pop the bubble, or trying to get someones attention to the bubble, or ... lighting is nice, i really like that background, and the textures there.', '2011-04-16 06:01:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6387777, 945858, 129267, '<td valign="top">I thought this was a fake flower at first, It has quite a bit of sparkly in it. <br/> <br/>overall, I find this image to fit the challenge, but not be terribly exciting. I''ve seen so many flower shots, that it''s hard to look at them, even when everything is technically good. <br/> <br/>there''s a weird string like object in the top of the flower, was that part of the plant?</td>', 'I thought this was a fake flower at first, It has quite a bit of sparkly in it.  overall, I find this image to fit the challenge, but not be terribly exciting. I''ve seen so many flower shots, that it''s hard to look at them, even when everything is technically good.  there''s a weird string like object in the top of the flower, was that part of the plant?', '2011-04-16 06:03:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6387778, 945807, 129267, '<td valign="top">the vase for this is gorgeous, and the highlights in it are amazing. the background is a good contrast from some of the more monochromatic images in this challenge. The lilies are actually the least interesting part of this shot, and I wonder if they''re even necessary.</td>', 'the vase for this is gorgeous, and the highlights in it are amazing. the background is a good contrast from some of the more monochromatic images in this challenge. The lilies are actually the least interesting part of this shot, and I wonder if they''re even necessary.', '2011-04-16 06:06:10.000000', NULL, 1),
(6387779, 945364, 129267, '<td valign="top">This has so much warm tones in it, that I feel it''d almost do better on that challenge.<br/> <br/>compositionally, I wish it showed either more of the lake, or more of the sky, as it sits now, I''m not sure which one is more important to the meaning of the shot.</td>', 'This has so much warm tones in it, that I feel it''d almost do better on that challenge. compositionally, I wish it showed either more of the lake, or more of the sky, as it sits now, I''m not sure which one is more important to the meaning of the shot.', '2011-04-16 06:07:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(6387780, 945302, 129267, '<td valign="top">Technically, it''s a very nicely done shot. exposure is good, focus, composition-- all spot on. <br/> <br/>on a more personal level, I''m not finding it to be a terribly exciting shot-- that is to say, it''s purely about the form, and not really making any sort of statement that can be long lasting.</td>', 'Technically, it''s a very nicely done shot. exposure is good, focus, composition-- all spot on.  on a more personal level, I''m not finding it to be a terribly exciting shot-- that is to say, it''s purely about the form, and not really making any sort of statement that can be long lasting.', '2011-04-16 06:12:11.000000', NULL, 1),
(6387781, 945134, 129267, '<td valign="top">I think this would do better to have been more cropped in, and focused on a specific part of the plant.<br/> <br/>as it sits now, there''s some extremely harsh highlights, and some of the non-plant parts are distracting. I like how hard the shadows fall on the right side, maybe that could be a more interesting shot?</td>', 'I think this would do better to have been more cropped in, and focused on a specific part of the plant. as it sits now, there''s some extremely harsh highlights, and some of the non-plant parts are distracting. I like how hard the shadows fall on the right side, maybe that could be a more interesting shot?', '2011-04-16 06:14:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6387782, 945121, 129267, '<td valign="top">Aren''t all flowers silent?<br/> <br/>I like the unique patterns in the stones, but i''m distracted a bit by the vase, and how much of it is in the frame. It''s cropped at a bit of a weird place, not quite center (horizontal or vertically) which further draws my eyes to the vase.</td>', 'Aren''t all flowers silent? I like the unique patterns in the stones, but i''m distracted a bit by the vase, and how much of it is in the frame. It''s cropped at a bit of a weird place, not quite center (horizontal or vertically) which further draws my eyes to the vase.', '2011-04-16 06:16:42.000000', NULL, 1),
