(6388260, 945032, 118070, '<td valign="top">This has a lot of potential, but I believe it would have been much better if you cropped out the edges of the glass.</td>', 'This has a lot of potential, but I believe it would have been much better if you cropped out the edges of the glass.', '2011-04-16 21:39:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388261, 946084, 118070, '<td valign="top">This is lovely, but the value of the beach seems a little too low.</td>', 'This is lovely, but the value of the beach seems a little too low.', '2011-04-16 21:40:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388262, 945804, 118070, '<td valign="top">The background is slightly speckled which is distracting from the portrait. I would''ve cropped out more of the top as well.</td>', 'The background is slightly speckled which is distracting from the portrait. I would''ve cropped out more of the top as well.', '2011-04-16 21:41:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388263, 945646, 118070, '<td valign="top">Excellent use of DOF.</td>', 'Excellent use of DOF.', '2011-04-16 21:41:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388264, 945807, 118070, '<td valign="top">I know it''s almost impossible to fix (trust me, I''ve tried) but you''re reflection in the vase is distracting.</td>', 'I know it''s almost impossible to fix (trust me, I''ve tried) but you''re reflection in the vase is distracting.', '2011-04-16 21:43:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388265, 945364, 118070, '<td valign="top">There are a lot of warm colours in this.</td>', 'There are a lot of warm colours in this.', '2011-04-16 21:43:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388267, 945473, 118070, '<td valign="top">Slightly too much editing in the feathers. The added sharpening is too much.</td>', 'Slightly too much editing in the feathers. The added sharpening is too much.', '2011-04-16 21:44:24.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388268, 945650, 118070, '<td valign="top">I really love this.</td>', 'I really love this.', '2011-04-16 21:44:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388272, 945777, 118070, '<td valign="top">This is incredible.</td>', 'This is incredible.', '2011-04-16 21:47:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388282, 946053, 118070, '<td valign="top">Personally I don''t like the border, but I like the image.</td>', 'Personally I don''t like the border, but I like the image.', '2011-04-16 22:08:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388404, 946083, 129267, '<td valign="top">interesting objects, each one has a very unique texture to it. With that in mind, I think the texture could have been emphasized a bit more with the lighting.</td>', 'interesting objects, each one has a very unique texture to it. With that in mind, I think the texture could have been emphasized a bit more with the lighting.', '2011-04-17 07:49:27.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388406, 946039, 129267, '<td valign="top">nice shapes, love the forms that are being made. feels a bit warm to me, with quite a bit of red in it. I think a bigger statement could have been made without the group of people in the shot. feels very ethereal and they jar me back to reality.</td>', 'nice shapes, love the forms that are being made. feels a bit warm to me, with quite a bit of red in it. I think a bigger statement could have been made without the group of people in the shot. feels very ethereal and they jar me back to reality.', '2011-04-17 07:51:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388407, 945873, 129267, '<td valign="top">hard to believe someone would paint a bench so dramatically. Composition is nice, DOF works. I think I would have liked the legs included in the selective saturation. editing and tone suggest a bit of creepiness -- dark vignette, high contrast, dead leaves/branches/weathering, but the colors don''t seem to match that feeling.</td>', 'hard to believe someone would paint a bench so dramatically. Composition is nice, DOF works. I think I would have liked the legs included in the selective saturation. editing and tone suggest a bit of creepiness -- dark vignette, high contrast, dead leaves/branches/weathering, but the colors don''t seem to match that feeling.', '2011-04-17 07:54:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388408, 946050, 129267, '<td valign="top">the feeling of motion is nice in this. I would have liked to have a focal point in it, I feel like i''m looking up a cow''s nose (lower right) or something.</td>', 'the feeling of motion is nice in this. I would have liked to have a focal point in it, I feel like i''m looking up a cow''s nose (lower right) or something.', '2011-04-17 07:56:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388410, 945844, 129267, '<td valign="top">I feel like the emphasis in this shot is actually the warm colors, the beautiful red''s and yellows of the cacti. The horizontal crop is refreshing, and quite pleasing, along with the crops in the foreframe.</td>', 'I feel like the emphasis in this shot is actually the warm colors, the beautiful red''s and yellows of the cacti. The horizontal crop is refreshing, and quite pleasing, along with the crops in the foreframe.', '2011-04-17 08:00:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388412, 945556, 129267, '<td valign="top">interesting shot, the fence in the foreground is nice to look at, and cements my interest. The sky is lovely, nice variation in tones, a great time of day to shoot. I think my only nit-pick is that I really don''t care much for the relatively ''centered'' poles- I wish they were scooted further right or left.</td>', 'interesting shot, the fence in the foreground is nice to look at, and cements my interest. The sky is lovely, nice variation in tones, a great time of day to shoot. I think my only nit-pick is that I really don''t care much for the relatively ''centered'' poles- I wish they were scooted further right or left.', '2011-04-17 08:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388414, 944939, 129267, '<td valign="top">Your model in this has quite a weird pose - It doesn''t look comfortable, or natural. It feels very mute in terms of color, especially those which are cool.</td>', 'Your model in this has quite a weird pose - It doesn''t look comfortable, or natural. It feels very mute in terms of color, especially those which are cool.', '2011-04-17 08:06:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388416, 945919, 129267, '<td valign="top">Statue is unique and interesting, and ... strange in that environment. The strong rotation causes a very large leading line down the torso/legs, and I feel a bit disappointed that I don''t get to see the full statue.</td>', 'Statue is unique and interesting, and ... strange in that environment. The strong rotation causes a very large leading line down the torso/legs, and I feel a bit disappointed that I don''t get to see the full statue.', '2011-04-17 08:08:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388418, 945945, 129267, '<td valign="top">Lovely shot, but I''m not really seeing even the slightest hint of cool colors. I don''t know what this object is, but I''m definitely intrigued by it, I love the textures, the type, and the mysterious locks.</td>', 'Lovely shot, but I''m not really seeing even the slightest hint of cool colors. I don''t know what this object is, but I''m definitely intrigued by it, I love the textures, the type, and the mysterious locks.', '2011-04-17 08:09:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388420, 945609, 129267, '<td valign="top">In this shot, I wish that the sharpness was pushed just a bit further. I like the composition and the strong diagonal line, the background is isolated well, and the lighting isn''t bad (a bit hard in some spots). I think I would have liked for the main focal point (the flowers) to be cool colors as opposed to the background.</td>', 'In this shot, I wish that the sharpness was pushed just a bit further. I like the composition and the strong diagonal line, the background is isolated well, and the lighting isn''t bad (a bit hard in some spots). I think I would have liked for the main focal point (the flowers) to be cool colors as opposed to the background.', '2011-04-17 08:11:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388423, 946045, 129267, '<td valign="top">I''m not a big fan of the angle this one was taken at, it feels a bit default. A low angle could have made this feel a bit more dramatic. The sun is relatively harsh, I bet this would have been really lovely if it were taken around sunrise.</td>', 'I''m not a big fan of the angle this one was taken at, it feels a bit default. A low angle could have made this feel a bit more dramatic. The sun is relatively harsh, I bet this would have been really lovely if it were taken around sunrise.', '2011-04-17 08:14:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388424, 945798, 129267, '<td valign="top">beautiful, and should do well. interesting composition, meets the challenge well, and nothing formally wrong. (seems strange that the water is so blue, is that PP, or simply a reflection?)</td>', 'beautiful, and should do well. interesting composition, meets the challenge well, and nothing formally wrong. (seems strange that the water is so blue, is that PP, or simply a reflection?)', '2011-04-17 08:16:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388426, 946086, 129267, '<td valign="top">nice color, the purple feels very cool, as compared to many of the other more reddish purples. My only weirdness in this is that white stuff on the leaf. is that pollen from the flowers, or a sickly plant?</td>', 'nice color, the purple feels very cool, as compared to many of the other more reddish purples. My only weirdness in this is that white stuff on the leaf. is that pollen from the flowers, or a sickly plant?', '2011-04-17 08:18:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388428, 946105, 129267, '<td valign="top">nice photo. My favorite part is where the powerlines meet both the sky and the mountain. there''s some wonderful contrast there. To be nit-picky, I wish this was a bit wider, other than that, wonderful.</td>', 'nice photo. My favorite part is where the powerlines meet both the sky and the mountain. there''s some wonderful contrast there. To be nit-picky, I wish this was a bit wider, other than that, wonderful.', '2011-04-17 08:20:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388429, 945387, 129267, '<td valign="top">well lit, interesting form. could use a little bit of highlight control (what is that yellow vertical line from?)<br/> <br/>very tranquil shot</td>', 'well lit, interesting form. could use a little bit of highlight control (what is that yellow vertical line from?) very tranquil shot', '2011-04-17 08:22:15.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388432, 946101, 129267, '<td valign="top">(don''t be so hard on yourself)<br/> <br/>I like the blue horizon, especially where it meets the white in the upper right. To get some more contrast in those cubes, you can use a black card in the off-frame, as a reflection.</td>', '(don''t be so hard on yourself) I like the blue horizon, especially where it meets the white in the upper right. To get some more contrast in those cubes, you can use a black card in the off-frame, as a reflection.', '2011-04-17 08:23:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388434, 946042, 129267, '<td valign="top">wonderful shot, very creepy-eerie. In terms of color, I wish there was one more tone besides just green and brown, but hey, can''t control that, right? <br/> <br/>one of the things that I find working in your favor is that below the bridge, you can''t tell the depth. it could be one foot, it could be 50, and when that''s combined with the weathered nature of the bridge, it really invites the viewer to make their own story up.</td>', 'wonderful shot, very creepy-eerie. In terms of color, I wish there was one more tone besides just green and brown, but hey, can''t control that, right?  one of the things that I find working in your favor is that below the bridge, you can''t tell the depth. it could be one foot, it could be 50, and when that''s combined with the weathered nature of the bridge, it really invites the viewer to make their own story up.', '2011-04-17 08:26:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388435, 945854, 129267, '<td valign="top">Interesting effect, I hope you share how it was done.</td>', 'Interesting effect, I hope you share how it was done.', '2011-04-17 08:27:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388437, 945941, 129267, '<td valign="top">It''s not a daydream -- it''s a mass produced ''paradise.''<br/> <br/>I like the shot, and not knowing whether it was taken from land, by boat, or from another dock. I think the cropping is a bit weird, the other canopies seemd to be distracting, I think I''d like it better if the one on the right with the red roof was cropped out. <br/> <br/>The sky seems borderline dramatic, I think a polarizing filter would make that pop, and bring this to the next level.</td>', 'It''s not a daydream -- it''s a mass produced ''paradise.'' I like the shot, and not knowing whether it was taken from land, by boat, or from another dock. I think the cropping is a bit weird, the other canopies seemd to be distracting, I think I''d like it better if the one on the right with the red roof was cropped out.  The sky seems borderline dramatic, I think a polarizing filter would make that pop, and bring this to the next level.', '2011-04-17 08:30:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388438, 945857, 129267, '<td valign="top">pretty and unique flowers, but I can''t help but look at the strange plasticine reflections on the left and right side. the violet in the background is nice, and adds some good color contrast.</td>', 'pretty and unique flowers, but I can''t help but look at the strange plasticine reflections on the left and right side. the violet in the background is nice, and adds some good color contrast.', '2011-04-17 08:31:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388441, 946044, 129267, '<td valign="top">excellent image, very nice capture of drama, wonderful colors. I think I''d lose the harsh white rule, tone it down to 40% or so, as that contrast tends to draw my eye off the image plane.</td>', 'excellent image, very nice capture of drama, wonderful colors. I think I''d lose the harsh white rule, tone it down to 40% or so, as that contrast tends to draw my eye off the image plane.', '2011-04-17 08:35:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388442, 945695, 129267, '<td valign="top">this image reminds me of an oil spill, there''s so many micro-reflections within the pools. I''m not a big fan of the title, but I can''t offer any other one, so apparently it can''t be that bad :D</td>', 'this image reminds me of an oil spill, there''s so many micro-reflections within the pools. I''m not a big fan of the title, but I can''t offer any other one, so apparently it can''t be that bad :D', '2011-04-17 08:39:58.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388545, 945448, 96751, '<td valign="top">wonderful clarity in the water</td>', 'wonderful clarity in the water', '2011-04-17 13:23:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388548, 945798, 96751, '<td valign="top">I love these fountains!  Nice abstract.</td>', 'I love these fountains!  Nice abstract.', '2011-04-17 13:23:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388617, 946006, 109387, '<td valign="top">It''s a wonderful picture but there are two things I don''t like: the editing of the sky and I don''t think it''s matching the title of the challenge - too warm colors.</td>', 'It''s a wonderful picture but there are two things I don''t like: the editing of the sky and I don''t think it''s matching the title of the challenge - too warm colors.', '2011-04-17 14:58:22.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388660, 945233, 39055, '<td valign="top"><u></u></td>', '', '2011-04-17 17:17:37.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388678, 945584, 129267, '<td valign="top">The DOF in this seems a bit narrow. By default, when there''s text I want to be able to see it clearly, and it''s juuuuust starting to blur out. I like the highlights in the candies, and the organization of them. I''m not a huge fan of the packaging, I think I would have tried to say the same thing with only one bag as opposed to having 3.</td>', 'The DOF in this seems a bit narrow. By default, when there''s text I want to be able to see it clearly, and it''s juuuuust starting to blur out. I like the highlights in the candies, and the organization of them. I''m not a huge fan of the packaging, I think I would have tried to say the same thing with only one bag as opposed to having 3.', '2011-04-17 17:53:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388679, 945826, 129267, '<td valign="top">Is that ice? very neat image, love the strong horizontal nature of the frozen bits, and how the background feels like impending doom. I wish the tree wasn''t so orange, it''d look awesome in a nice creamy bluegreen tone.</td>', 'Is that ice? very neat image, love the strong horizontal nature of the frozen bits, and how the background feels like impending doom. I wish the tree wasn''t so orange, it''d look awesome in a nice creamy bluegreen tone.', '2011-04-17 17:55:25.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388680, 945804, 129267, '<td valign="top">lots of interest for such a simple shot. I like the eyeshadow, and the hard edges of her face. There''s so many strong shapes when presented on black like this. I think I''d like to see the lower bit cropped a bit more, just above her ear, to emphasize outline even more.</td>', 'lots of interest for such a simple shot. I like the eyeshadow, and the hard edges of her face. There''s so many strong shapes when presented on black like this. I think I''d like to see the lower bit cropped a bit more, just above her ear, to emphasize outline even more.', '2011-04-17 17:58:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388682, 945335, 129267, '<td valign="top">I don''t know what''s going on, but I like it. It''s all a bit strange, the dog''s pose, and look to the right, and her large smile, and left gaze, the one missing shoe. It all allows for a ton of interpretations. <br/> <br/>on the formal side, I wish the do had a bit more exposure. I can see this working well in b&amp;w as well.</td>', 'I don''t know what''s going on, but I like it. It''s all a bit strange, the dog''s pose, and look to the right, and her large smile, and left gaze, the one missing shoe. It all allows for a ton of interpretations.  on the formal side, I wish the do had a bit more exposure. I can see this working well in b&w as well.', '2011-04-17 18:00:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388683, 945901, 129267, '<td valign="top">Because of the angle that this was taken from, it tends to feel a bit snapshotty. I like the reference in the title, and that does save it quite a bit. The dark parts in this really make the image, there''s a lot of interesting shapes to follow and be led around, and when I get to the bottom, the pink is a bit strong, and wants to keep my vision there.</td>', 'Because of the angle that this was taken from, it tends to feel a bit snapshotty. I like the reference in the title, and that does save it quite a bit. The dark parts in this really make the image, there''s a lot of interesting shapes to follow and be led around, and when I get to the bottom, the pink is a bit strong, and wants to keep my vision there.', '2011-04-17 18:03:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388684, 945650, 129267, '<td valign="top">feels so retro, these generic blobs of plastic. This is spot on compositionally. colors seem a bit strange, did the concrete have a green color cast initially, or was that something that happened in post?</td>', 'feels so retro, these generic blobs of plastic. This is spot on compositionally. colors seem a bit strange, did the concrete have a green color cast initially, or was that something that happened in post?', '2011-04-17 18:05:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388685, 946131, 129267, '<td valign="top">The crystal like figure reminds me of a matchstick. <br/> <br/>I think this image could use a bit more cool colors in it, there''s a lot of dark colors, and then the primary focal point is composed of warm colors.</td>', 'The crystal like figure reminds me of a matchstick.  I think this image could use a bit more cool colors in it, there''s a lot of dark colors, and then the primary focal point is composed of warm colors.', '2011-04-17 18:07:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388686, 945986, 129267, '<td valign="top">Wonderful image and title. Many many interesting things going on. I''d like to see just a hair more exposure or bounced light on the dresser</td>', 'Wonderful image and title. Many many interesting things going on. I''d like to see just a hair more exposure or bounced light on the dresser', '2011-04-17 18:08:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388687, 945328, 129267, '<td valign="top">I''m not terribly familiar with snow/cold environments, is this simply water frozen over? it has such intense texture to it, and I''m really curious as to what causes those micro sparkles. The gradation of tone from white to blue is also nice, and helps maintain interest.</td>', 'I''m not terribly familiar with snow/cold environments, is this simply water frozen over? it has such intense texture to it, and I''m really curious as to what causes those micro sparkles. The gradation of tone from white to blue is also nice, and helps maintain interest.', '2011-04-17 18:13:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388689, 945282, 129267, '<td valign="top">I like this shot, I think I would have focused a bit more on the closer eye rather than the far (or just not have used such a rapidly declining aperature). Her face is full of emotion, and the lighting adds to the drama.</td>', 'I like this shot, I think I would have focused a bit more on the closer eye rather than the far (or just not have used such a rapidly declining aperature). Her face is full of emotion, and the lighting adds to the drama.', '2011-04-17 18:15:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388695, 946036, 129267, '<td valign="top">:| <br/> <br/>interesting texture. doesn''t speak terribly to me, it feels a bit flat, especially for having so many areas of degradation. I think some side-lighting would help bring out some small shadows and make this pop a bit.</td>', ':|  interesting texture. doesn''t speak terribly to me, it feels a bit flat, especially for having so many areas of degradation. I think some side-lighting would help bring out some small shadows and make this pop a bit.', '2011-04-17 18:42:31.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388696, 946127, 129267, '<td valign="top">Nice expression, works well with the title. The animal print works well with the age of the model. lighting is so precise, I''d love to know the setup to this.</td>', 'Nice expression, works well with the title. The animal print works well with the age of the model. lighting is so precise, I''d love to know the setup to this.', '2011-04-17 18:44:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388698, 945555, 129267, '<td valign="top">very calming. The water is so ethereal. <br/> <br/>Composition is nice, well framed. It seems a bit on the dark side, but that doesn''t bother me too much. I don''t really like the bridge in the background, it snaps me out of the solitude of the piece.</td>', 'very calming. The water is so ethereal.  Composition is nice, well framed. It seems a bit on the dark side, but that doesn''t bother me too much. I don''t really like the bridge in the background, it snaps me out of the solitude of the piece.', '2011-04-17 18:47:16.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388699, 945598, 129267, '<td valign="top">I like her expression, and the freckles are charming. The eyes feel a bit over processed, just a smidge too bright for the rest of the photograph. If the low''s were a bit lower, creating more contrast, I think the eyes would be fine.</td>', 'I like her expression, and the freckles are charming. The eyes feel a bit over processed, just a smidge too bright for the rest of the photograph. If the low''s were a bit lower, creating more contrast, I think the eyes would be fine.', '2011-04-17 18:50:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388700, 946063, 129267, '<td valign="top">Love the OOF parts, and the left side of the image. It reminds me of a freshly waxed car, smooth, and with wonderful diffusion. This is exposed extremely well, I know I would have over exposed it.</td>', 'Love the OOF parts, and the left side of the image. It reminds me of a freshly waxed car, smooth, and with wonderful diffusion. This is exposed extremely well, I know I would have over exposed it.', '2011-04-17 18:51:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388703, 945233, 129267, '<td valign="top">This feels really really really overly sharpened in post. It''s hard to actually focus and see any sort of detail of the dragonfly.</td>', 'This feels really really really overly sharpened in post. It''s hard to actually focus and see any sort of detail of the dragonfly.', '2011-04-17 18:54:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388705, 946049, 129267, '<td valign="top">I thought that these were really interesting beer cans initially, then was disappointed to read "grape soda" :D<br/>colors and lighting seem to be spot on, the condensation is nice, like the small drops as opposed to big ones. The left can being rotated and cropped seems weird, and makes this feel candid as opposed to setup (same with the different can croppings on top)</td>', 'I thought that these were really interesting beer cans initially, then was disappointed to read "grape soda" :Dcolors and lighting seem to be spot on, the condensation is nice, like the small drops as opposed to big ones. The left can being rotated and cropped seems weird, and makes this feel candid as opposed to setup (same with the different can croppings on top)', '2011-04-17 18:56:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388706, 945473, 129267, '<td valign="top">I love macaws, they have such interesting faces. <br/> <br/>For this shot, i wish the aperture was one or two steps higher. The face seems to be infocus, and I would love if its forefeathers were just a bit sharper.</td>', 'I love macaws, they have such interesting faces.  For this shot, i wish the aperture was one or two steps higher. The face seems to be infocus, and I would love if its forefeathers were just a bit sharper.', '2011-04-17 18:58:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388707, 946077, 129267, '<td valign="top">Interesting. Love the generous space on the left, and the slight warmth beneath her eyes. The smokey background seems appropriate, not tacky, and adds some needed contrast/texture.</td>', 'Interesting. Love the generous space on the left, and the slight warmth beneath her eyes. The smokey background seems appropriate, not tacky, and adds some needed contrast/texture.', '2011-04-17 19:00:48.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388718, 946024, 129267, '<td valign="top">Interesting lines, the dark edges are strange, and make this feel very topographical. I would have liked to have seen more color, or more variation of tone.</td>', 'Interesting lines, the dark edges are strange, and make this feel very topographical. I would have liked to have seen more color, or more variation of tone.', '2011-04-17 19:29:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388720, 945264, 129267, '<td valign="top">feels a bit on the snapshotty side - the lighting is so harsh, and the crop isn''t helping with telling any sort of story.</td>', 'feels a bit on the snapshotty side - the lighting is so harsh, and the crop isn''t helping with telling any sort of story.', '2011-04-17 19:30:55.000000', NULL, 1),
