(6388728, 945531, 129267, '<td valign="top">Nice exposure and composition. <br/> <br/>having the tree''s not in the frame would make this a perfect shot.</td>', 'Nice exposure and composition.  having the tree''s not in the frame would make this a perfect shot.', '2011-04-17 19:34:03.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388734, 945555, 44877, '<td valign="top">I''d love to know how to process water so it looks like that.</td>', 'I''d love to know how to process water so it looks like that.', '2011-04-17 19:34:42.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388737, 945668, 129267, '<td valign="top">nice focus, and capture of that sheen. above and beyond that, it really doesn''t do anything for me. the subject seems so ordinary.</td>', 'nice focus, and capture of that sheen. above and beyond that, it really doesn''t do anything for me. the subject seems so ordinary.', '2011-04-17 19:35:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388739, 945310, 129267, '<td valign="top">great shot. like the little micro dusts. nothing I''d do differently.</td>', 'great shot. like the little micro dusts. nothing I''d do differently.', '2011-04-17 19:36:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388740, 945646, 129267, '<td valign="top">and the award for longest title goes to..... :D<br/> <br/>Nice shot. The purple border feels a bit thick. the DOF is nice, and exposure seems good.</td>', 'and the award for longest title goes to..... :D Nice shot. The purple border feels a bit thick. the DOF is nice, and exposure seems good.', '2011-04-17 19:38:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388741, 945800, 129267, '<td valign="top">the chrome is interesting, as is the water. I''d like to see the background replaced with something that''s not quite so textural, and maybe get the crop a little bit lower. good shot!</td>', 'the chrome is interesting, as is the water. I''d like to see the background replaced with something that''s not quite so textural, and maybe get the crop a little bit lower. good shot!', '2011-04-17 19:39:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388743, 945942, 129267, '<td valign="top">dark and creepy, as you planned. I would have liked for this to feel a bit cooler, right now the emphasis seems to be on the darkness.</td>', 'dark and creepy, as you planned. I would have liked for this to feel a bit cooler, right now the emphasis seems to be on the darkness.', '2011-04-17 19:40:33.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388744, 946056, 129267, '<td valign="top">nice use of selective desaturation, and DOF. the top is a bit hot, I think I''d crop that part out.</td>', 'nice use of selective desaturation, and DOF. the top is a bit hot, I think I''d crop that part out.', '2011-04-17 19:42:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388746, 945894, 129267, '<td valign="top">interesting shot, love the lighting and the textures. colors feel a bit warm to me.</td>', 'interesting shot, love the lighting and the textures. colors feel a bit warm to me.', '2011-04-17 19:43:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388750, 946067, 129267, '<td valign="top">this flower feels very electric, very neon. I wish it were a bit sharper focused.</td>', 'this flower feels very electric, very neon. I wish it were a bit sharper focused.', '2011-04-17 19:49:29.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388751, 946128, 129267, '<td valign="top">Wish this had a stronger title, it''s actually a pretty interesting photograph. I really enjoy the darkness and reflections within the orb.</td>', 'Wish this had a stronger title, it''s actually a pretty interesting photograph. I really enjoy the darkness and reflections within the orb.', '2011-04-17 19:50:41.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388752, 946089, 129267, '<td valign="top">beautiful watercolor photography. Wish there were a bit more of the white tones, as the dark tones in the left feel more sinister. <br/> <br/>would love to see how this was made as well, I do hope you''ll share.</td>', 'beautiful watercolor photography. Wish there were a bit more of the white tones, as the dark tones in the left feel more sinister.  would love to see how this was made as well, I do hope you''ll share.', '2011-04-17 19:52:12.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388753, 945751, 129267, '<td valign="top">This feels not very exciting. the crop feel s a bit default, and the lighting is a bit dark. I think raising the lights and illuminating the inside of the flower a bit more, making it pop from the background would take this further.</td>', 'This feels not very exciting. the crop feel s a bit default, and the lighting is a bit dark. I think raising the lights and illuminating the inside of the flower a bit more, making it pop from the background would take this further.', '2011-04-17 19:53:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388754, 945777, 129267, '<td valign="top">not very often I say wow when voting. I''d love to see a version of this on white, to know whether it still holds this much impact.</td>', 'not very often I say wow when voting. I''d love to see a version of this on white, to know whether it still holds this much impact.', '2011-04-17 19:53:55.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388755, 945821, 129267, '<td valign="top">I like this photograph, but the whole thing feels a bit warm. the green is full of yellows, the background is orange and red.<br/> <br/>compositionally, I like it, it''s interesting, and the very very minute shadows make this feel borderline unreal. the texture is also well done.</td>', 'I like this photograph, but the whole thing feels a bit warm. the green is full of yellows, the background is orange and red. compositionally, I like it, it''s interesting, and the very very minute shadows make this feel borderline unreal. the texture is also well done.', '2011-04-17 19:57:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(6388756, 946098, 129267, '<td valign="top">I love the tire, and how it tells the story of its past. I wish that could be isolated a bit better from the background. The fence is so dense, and is fighting a bit to be the subject.</td>', 'I love the tire, and how it tells the story of its past. I wish that could be isolated a bit better from the background. The fence is so dense, and is fighting a bit to be the subject.', '2011-04-17 19:58:51.000000', NULL, 1),
