(6390182, 945407, 131377, '<td valign="top">I love horses, but it''s almost difficult to tell that they''re horses. It looks almost like a photo of a painting.</td>', 'I love horses, but it''s almost difficult to tell that they''re horses. It looks almost like a photo of a painting.', '2011-04-19 12:14:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(6390184, 946098, 131377, '<td valign="top">When I was little, I sat in one of those and the treebranch snapped and hit me in the noggin. Trust grandpa, whose glasses are thicker than jar bottoms, to find a branch that''s rotten all the way through.<br/> <br/>Good photo, btw. :)</td>', 'When I was little, I sat in one of those and the treebranch snapped and hit me in the noggin. Trust grandpa, whose glasses are thicker than jar bottoms, to find a branch that''s rotten all the way through. Good photo, btw. :)', '2011-04-19 12:25:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(6390188, 946006, 131377, '<td valign="top">Something about the editing I don''t like. Can''t put my finger on it exactly. I don''t like the colors in the sky, looks too much like magma. Also, your sheperd has a reddish glow on his right side, but it''s only him. Nothing else has that glow, and there isn''t much red to the far right of the sky; it''s mostly straight on. The reflection of the sky in the water around the sheperds feet looks blue and cloudy, so it doesn''t match the sky very much. I really like the focus and clarity of the photo though. IDK, it seems to me a bit over-edited?<br/> <br/>Honestly, I don''t really know what I''m doing though, so there might be people who compliment you on what I''ve critiqued.</td>', 'Something about the editing I don''t like. Can''t put my finger on it exactly. I don''t like the colors in the sky, looks too much like magma. Also, your sheperd has a reddish glow on his right side, but it''s only him. Nothing else has that glow, and there isn''t much red to the far right of the sky; it''s mostly straight on. The reflection of the sky in the water around the sheperds feet looks blue and cloudy, so it doesn''t match the sky very much. I really like the focus and clarity of the photo though. IDK, it seems to me a bit over-edited? Honestly, I don''t really know what I''m doing though, so there might be people who compliment you on what I''ve critiqued.', '2011-04-19 12:30:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(6390191, 945609, 131377, '<td valign="top">This is a GREAT photo, but I don''t get a sense of "cool colors" from it. In fact, it makes me feel a bit warm.</td>', 'This is a GREAT photo, but I don''t get a sense of "cool colors" from it. In fact, it makes me feel a bit warm.', '2011-04-19 12:33:05.000000', NULL, 1),
(6390192, 946092, 131377, '<td valign="top">Oh wow. I''ve never seen a damselfly that close before. Does it have eggs on its stomach?<br/> <br/>I would have liked this better if the entire insect was in focus, but the way it is is still really cool. :)</td>', 'Oh wow. I''ve never seen a damselfly that close before. Does it have eggs on its stomach? I would have liked this better if the entire insect was in focus, but the way it is is still really cool. :)', '2011-04-19 12:34:28.000000', NULL, 1),
(6390194, 945858, 131377, '<td valign="top">There is a hair or piece of fuzz that is really distracting to me, lol. Other than that, it''s good. :)</td>', 'There is a hair or piece of fuzz that is really distracting to me, lol. Other than that, it''s good. :)', '2011-04-19 12:35:21.000000', NULL, 1),
