(6390890, 946120, 130694, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by jamesgoss:</b></div><hr/><i> I do wish that this had more breathing room around it. I like it from an experimental approach, I think for a challenge on color it''s a bit devoid, as such it probably will get killed by some of the other voters. <br/> <br/>there''s some light spill onto your clothes and face, I think I''d wear all dark clothes next time, and see if that would help blend you more. I''d like to see more light painting on the guitar, maybe light "buttons" on the male?<br/> <br/>-not participating </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>Thank you for the input, I actually chose to have some of the color light her up, I felt it showed a little more ''cool'' emotion.</td>', 'Originally posted by jamesgoss: I do wish that this had more breathing room around it. I like it from an experimental approach, I think for a challenge on color it''s a bit devoid, as such it probably will get killed by some of the other voters.  there''s some light spill onto your clothes and face, I think I''d wear all dark clothes next time, and see if that would help blend you more. I''d like to see more light painting on the guitar, maybe light "buttons" on the male? -not participating   Thank you for the input, I actually chose to have some of the color light her up, I felt it showed a little more ''cool'' emotion.', '2011-04-20 01:40:38.000000', NULL, 0),
