(6392717, 945134, 67152, '<td valign="top">For pictures like this where you are trying to pull out shapes and textures, I would recommend shooting this at a different time of day.  The harsh light of mid day is usually the worst time of day for taking pictures.  Pick morning before the sun gets too high or late in the afternoon/ evening.</td>', 'For pictures like this where you are trying to pull out shapes and textures, I would recommend shooting this at a different time of day.  The harsh light of mid day is usually the worst time of day for taking pictures.  Pick morning before the sun gets too high or late in the afternoon/ evening.', '2011-04-22 08:51:22.000000', NULL, 0),
