(6394157, 945807, 112972, '<td valign="top">I believe DPC advanced editing rules allow multiple shots for increased depth of field (read the first paragraph under the advanced editing rules), so I guess you could have still left the flowers in the bottle and taken multiple shots with various focus points and then blended them together in photoshop (edit-&gt; Auto-Blend Layers ...) ... or have I misunderstood the rule?<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2011-04-25 02:00:57.</i></td>', 'I believe DPC advanced editing rules allow multiple shots for increased depth of field (read the first paragraph under the advanced editing rules), so I guess you could have still left the flowers in the bottle and taken multiple shots with various focus points and then blended them together in photoshop (edit-> Auto-Blend Layers ...) ... or have I misunderstood the rule?', '2011-04-24 18:27:44.000000', '2011-04-25 03:00:57.000000', 0),
